{"detail": {"templateUuid": "983f62be6ce4461c9371af1674fd5482", "projectUuid": "c31e74760a444bfca6c7d4c7d8031e09", "name": "原创电影大作《御甲》万骸之战", "description": "如果结局早注定，那过程是否可以改变？\n相传，女娲补天时遗落的矿材，被古人铸成守护城池的御甲。卒林关是诸城重要的采集据点，也是城中人最后的家园。人们曾以为，只有拥有凌霄气的人才能走进驾驶舱；其实，让人握住操纵杆的，不只是凌霄气，还有明知危险、仍愿意为他人挺身而出的勇气与决心。\n如今兽潮压境，“青枢”五御士驾驶五甲并肩迎战。巨兽聚合，一次次迎向兽潮，为身后的人守住家园。\n即使前方是一场注定的败局，下一步怎么走，仍由你自己决定。", "coverUrl": "/assets/1595891298be49cb.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/5a050b85b53345acad43f2194b3469d5/f1f68c8a4922eafae59eb572ef86c837f5c8e2e2.mp4", "snapshotId": 49889, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3115384, "ownerUuid": "5a050b85b53345acad43f2194b3469d5", "avatar": "/assets/de8863dbc40a7deb.webp", "nickname": "星年Dream", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 3, "tags": [{"id": 3063, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "王者无界剧场计划", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3063/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "【原创作品《御甲》万骸之战 序章】 https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MRh46uEHH/?share_source=copy_web&vd_source=4bd243e5dc269fb02fce0536f218e7c8", "skillKeyList": ["cinematic-storyboard-splitter-5fb701673162478e9204228c2b8919c6"], "sessionSnapshots": [{"sessionId": "31c59adb-b46d-4903-80d9-2132a0a8f76e", "name": "", "createdAtMs": 1789460072236, "shareId": "r2ySosKT2W", "lastMessageId": "1116651364879974400_skill_summary"}, {"sessionId": "969fca1a-022c-4a3d-abde-411a990bd3bd", "name": "视频丢失排查", "createdAtMs": 1789368820758, "shareId": "MuxwVF5HeG", "lastMessageId": "1113515970034319366"}], "skillTemplateList": [{"skillKey": "cinematic-storyboard-splitter-5fb701673162478e9204228c2b8919c6", "name": "影视级剧本分镜拆分导演", "templateUuid": "17ea398b5bdf4701858dd8c6963838a1"}], "shareIds": ["r2ySosKT2W", "MuxwVF5HeG"], "createAt": "20